Ticket `#4471` was marked known as a single issue (`dates parse mm/dd in eu locales`), with 412 unique reports (from 427 exported rows across overlapping pages) merged by subject line under [decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject). Reading the tenant configuration (`locales.ts`), cause rules (`causes.ts`), and report bodies (`desk-notes.json`) shows two causes (`parser` and `hint`) plus 5 `oneDayMove` reports filed under `parser`.

<Callout>
Resolved 05 Oct (#4471 closed): parser fixed (fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales), hint won't fix (booking-v3 form retired).
</Callout>

## What was merged into #4471

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

## Engineering update (closed 05 Oct)

- **[#1 · `parser`](https://github.com/olafkrawczyk/support-kb-4471/issues/1)** (**fixed** — `fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`) — **379** reports under `causeOf() === 'parser'` (**374** month/day-swap reports plus **5** reports read as a one-day move in `desk-notes.json`) across all 11 day-first tenants on `app` (204), `email` (150), and `booking-v2` `form` (25, where the hint is `DD/MM/YYYY`), seen `2026-04-01` → `2026-10-04`.
- **[#2 · `hint`](https://github.com/olafkrawczyk/support-kb-4471/issues/2)** (**won't fix** — `booking-v3 form retired`) — **33** reports on the `form` channel across the 3 tenants running `booking-v3` (`alder.physio` ×12, `copper.studio` ×11, `pale.harbour` ×10), seen `2026-04-17` → `2026-09-22`. People follow the `MM/DD/YYYY` hint under the field while the form parses day-first.
- **[#3 · `oneDayMove`](https://github.com/olafkrawczyk/support-kb-4471/issues/3)** (tracked in `desk-notes.json`, filed under `parser` by tenant) — **5** reports (`R-41202`, `R-41209`, `R-41236`, `R-41344`, `R-41620`) across 5 tenants (`kettle.books`, `alder.physio`, `nine.lanterns`, `pale.harbour`, `lantern.row`), seen `2026-04-02` → `2026-10-04`.

## Since April

<QueueTimeline ticket={4471} />

## Why intake tags disagreed

`meta.intakeTag` guessed the cause from `browserLocale` when each report arrived (`parser ×371`, `hint ×41` across all 412 reports: `parser ×356 · hint ×23` on the 379 `parser` reports, and `hint ×18 · parser ×15` on the 33 `hint` reports). The actual cause depends on the tenant's configured locale (`dayFirst(tenant.locale)`), channel (`app`, `email`, or `form`), and booking form (`booking-v2` vs `booking-v3`).

